                                "sense_id": "ad539c86-c759-3369-9d10-80ea4f358bc1",
                                "text": "In this game of bluff and counter-bluff, the parlementaires calculated that their absence – which entailed much of the country being without an appellate jurisdiction – would force the government to treat for terms."
